{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-common-biology-03","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"biology","number":3,"points":2,"unitId":"enzyme","unitLabel":"효소","topic":"Km","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["enzyme","biomol"],"stem":"표는 촉매 기작이 서로 동일한 효소 A, B, C의 특성을 비교한 \n것이다.\nKcat/KM\n효소\nKM (M)\nKcat (sec-1)\n6 M\n-1 sec\n-1)\n(10\nA\n  20\n20\n1.00\nB\n  500\n 5\n0.01\nC\n2,000\n 4\n0.002\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n(단, 효소 A, B, C는 동일한 위치의 아미노산 하나만 서로 다르다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 효소의 기질 친화력은 A가 가장 크다.\nㄴ. 촉매 효율(catalytic efficiency)은 C가 A보다 500 배 더 크다.\nㄷ. 촉매 전환율(catalytic turnover number)은 C가 B보다 4 배 \n더 크다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t030"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":779,"height":237,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,50.103,311.6,94.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-03/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":774,"height":227,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,206.103,309.6,90.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t025","t026","t027","t028","t029"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-03/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.297,417.0,501.322],"width":334.1,"height":349.025,"items":[{"type":"image","ass